  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For a function to be continuous&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we know&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mroot><mrow><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>729</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>7</mn></mroot><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mroot><mrow><mn>729</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>limit should be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;from</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mroot><mrow><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>729</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>7</mn></mroot><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mroot><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>.</mo><mn>729</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mroot><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>729</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mroot><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>7</mn></mroot><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mroot><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>q</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; (multiplying the equation by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>q</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
